  "name": "Question 5",
  "problem": "Which of the following probabilities could be approximated using the normal approximation of the binomial distribution?\n\nI. The probability that more than $3$ flights out of $5$ take off on time from an airport if the probability of a single flight taking off on time is $0.8$ for each flight.\n\nII. The probability of getting $7$ ones on $10$ rolls of a $4$-sided die.\n\nIII. The probability of getting $32$ odd numbers on $80$ rolls of a $6$-sided die.",
